Phosphorus-Loaded Biochar-Assisted Phytoremediation to
Immobilize Cadmium, Chromium, and Lead in Soils
María F. Serrano, Julián E. López, Nancy Henao, and Juan F. Saldarriaga*
Cite This: ACS Omega 2024, 9, 3574−3587

